WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.600
Donald Trump's press secretary, Haley McInerney,
was asked at her Monday press briefing by

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.650
reporters whether Donald Trump plans to resume
the Corona virus press briefings, and she

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.960
didn't answer the question.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.300
But the answer is obviously no.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:20.199
And it's a good question to ask because we're
seeing massive corona virus hot spots growing

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:26.520
very rapidly in the United States, mostly
different areas than the early hot spots.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.800
And I'm going to talk about the virus itself
shortly.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.820
But there's a real media story here to understand.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:36.450
We talk about the bully pulpit of corporate
media.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:41.820
Much of what is in the national discussion,
the top three stories that are in the national

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.760
discussion at any given time are essentially
led by corporate media.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.520
And this is called agenda setting power.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:55.390
It's not necessarily that corporate media
tells us what to think about any particular

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.890
issue, although sometimes they do.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:03.600
But it's that corporate media tells us what
to think about, what to talk about.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.859
And I'll give you an example.

00:01:04.859 --> 00:01:08.409
Remember, kids in cages, the immigration scandal.

00:01:08.409 --> 00:01:13.320
It's still going on, but it's rarely, if ever,
in the media, except he mentioned that some

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:17.890
people being held at the border have contracted
coronavirus.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:23.349
But nothing has fundamentally changed about
that story, which was wall to wall coverage

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.359
previously during this administration.

00:01:25.359 --> 00:01:27.429
Now it's like it doesn't exist.

00:01:27.429 --> 00:01:28.869
Then it was coronavirus.

00:01:28.869 --> 00:01:29.979
We have a pandemic.

00:01:29.979 --> 00:01:35.119
Daily press briefings, including Donald Trump
and doctors Foushee and Ben Daily updates

00:01:35.119 --> 00:01:39.890
down to the specific details about the number
of masks and project air bridge flights from

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:40.890
Mike Pence.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.549
And then the White House signaled we're going
to stop.

00:01:43.549 --> 00:01:48.329
Trump wondered aloud about injecting bleach
and isopropyl alcohol to treat Corona virus.

00:01:48.329 --> 00:01:51.770
It became clear that the White House didn't
really want more visibility for doctors.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.009
Burks and Foushee talking about the virus.

00:01:54.009 --> 00:01:55.280
So the briefing stopped.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:59.969
And with that, over time, as more and more
states have decided to reopen, some are safely

00:01:59.969 --> 00:02:00.969
reopening.

00:02:00.969 --> 00:02:02.569
Some are very unsafely reopening.

00:02:02.569 --> 00:02:07.819
The topic of the virus itself started to take
a backseat, especially as the George Floyd

00:02:07.819 --> 00:02:11.510
killing took place and the massive protests
started.

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:16.180
And now, as we're seeing, the protests are
starting to die down a little bit.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:21.150
But the big topic has become defund the police
or do not defund the police, depending on

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.959
whose perspective you're listening to.

00:02:22.959 --> 00:02:26.989
Right wing media saying defunding the police
would be anarchy.

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:31.790
Some on the left furious that Biden does not
want to defund the police, but understand

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:36.859
that nothing materially has changed with Corona
virus.

00:02:36.859 --> 00:02:39.269
We'll look at the data, put it up on the screen.

00:02:39.269 --> 00:02:45.511
Now, fortunately, as you can see, we've seen
a leveling off and a slow decline in the number

00:02:45.511 --> 00:02:48.010
of cases at the national level.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:54.569
But mostly what we're seeing is the cases
being relocated where we are finding new hotspots.

00:02:54.569 --> 00:02:59.550
Understand that at the peak we were finding
25 to 30000 cases a day.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:06.600
We are still finding 19 to 25000 new cases
every single day.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:12.230
And the number of active cases, meaning people
who currently have the virus, is still as

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.650
high as it's ever been.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.499
And yet Donald Trump barely talks about coronavirus.

00:03:16.499 --> 00:03:20.019
His press secretary barely talks about coronavirus.

00:03:20.019 --> 00:03:22.550
Right wing media is done with it.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:28.290
Other than calling it a scam or a conspiracy,
and even corporate media is increasingly talking

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:31.209
about corona virus less and less.

00:03:31.209 --> 00:03:35.349
But we have a new political article that points
out not only is the pandemic still very much

00:03:35.349 --> 00:03:38.329
a pandemic with no effective treatment, no
vaccine.

00:03:38.329 --> 00:03:42.620
We have new hotspots that are setting records
for new cases.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:47.440
There are parts of the country that are exploding
with virus cases.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.129
And Donald Trump is just silent.

00:03:49.129 --> 00:03:56.040
Another massive failure, because Trump, by
not talking about it, makes people think the

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.780
threat is over.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:01.980
Meaning they go out and behave responsibly
and cause even more cases.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:05.370
And in fact, as we talked about yesterday
on the bonus show, Donald Trump is planning

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:10.659
to restart his huge Mago rallies as part of
his 20-20 reelection campaign in a couple

00:04:10.659 --> 00:04:11.659
of weeks.

00:04:11.659 --> 00:04:13.620
So I'll give you some really specific examples.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:18.040
Texas, which started to reopen pretty quickly,
is exploding week to week.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.320
They have more and more cases.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:24.310
The number of active cases in Texas is higher
today than it has ever been.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:29.550
Florida, run by Republican Governor Ron DeSantis,
also started to open pretty early.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:32.710
They were caught lying about numbers as we
previously covered.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:37.970
And after a small dip sometime in April, which
might have just been then lying, they once

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:41.810
again in Florida are seeing record numbers
of new cases.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:46.830
Now, I mentioned that the cases are dramatically
shifting from some parts of the country to

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.889
others.

00:04:47.889 --> 00:04:51.120
This doesn't mean, you know, things aren't
going terribly everywhere.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:57.740
I am thrilled to say that here in Massachusetts,
at least for now, cases have been very steadily

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.139
declining since late a.

00:04:59.139 --> 00:05:01.020
Roll the graph I'm showing you.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.620
You'll see a one day spike.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:03.710
About a week ago.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.120
That's not really a spike.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.539
That was a bunch of presumptive cases from
the three months of Corona virus were all

00:05:10.539 --> 00:05:12.199
added in on that day.

00:05:12.199 --> 00:05:15.810
But we are looking really good here and I'm
thrilled to see that.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:21.410
So this is a story not just about the virus
itself, which is still raging with no treatment

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:27.259
or vaccine, but it's a media story as well
about the agenda setting power that corporate

00:05:27.259 --> 00:05:28.449
media has.

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:33.770
We said six safe seven weeks ago, Trump strategy
is going to be just start pretending it doesn't

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:34.770
exist.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.889
Start talking about the economy, jobs, reopening,
and a bunch of corporate media has played

00:05:38.889 --> 00:05:39.889
along.

00:05:39.889 --> 00:05:44.910
Now, in the meantime, things are so bad here
in the United States with Corona virus that

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:49.490
as more and more countries are reopening travel,
the United States is being banned.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.729
I'll give you an example.

00:05:50.729 --> 00:05:57.770
Iceland has so dominated the virus that Iceland
decided that on, I believe, its June 15th,

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.440
they're going to reopen tourism.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.270
When you get to Iceland, you have to have
a Cauvin test at the airport or quarantine

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:05.150
for 14 days.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.360
People are going to be able to go to Iceland
and start doing tourism if that's what they

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.509
want to do.

00:06:09.509 --> 00:06:13.840
Except Americans aren't going to be allowed
because things are so out of control here.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:18.159
Other countries, people are going to be allowed
to start going to Iceland, not Americans,

00:06:18.159 --> 00:06:19.560
because it's a disaster.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:24.620
And I wouldn't be surprised if this continues
as the virus keeps spreading in different

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.139
U.S. states.

00:06:26.139 --> 00:06:29.610
Other countries are going to be increasingly
controlling it.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.909
Not Brazil, India.

00:06:30.909 --> 00:06:34.849
You know, there's places that are Russia that
aren't controlling it, but more and more countries

00:06:34.849 --> 00:06:37.530
are going to be allowed to restart travel.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:42.069
And Americans are going to be banned from
going to other countries because it is so

00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:43.319
poorly handled here.

00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:51.150
Now, as far as the framing and the propaganda,
expect Trump soon to start arguing that and

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:56.710
TFA and other left wing protesters are responsible
for spreading the virus.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:07:01.319
If the numbers keep growing and a lot of these
new hot spots like Florida and Texas.

00:07:01.319 --> 00:07:06.199
I would anticipate that Donald Trump will
take the protests as the perfect opportunity

00:07:06.199 --> 00:07:09.580
to say it's an fire and lefties that are now
responsible.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:15.720
If he even mentions it at all and to be clear,
the protests will cause some number of new

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:16.830
cases.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:21.889
What we're seeing now is reflective of the
situation 10 to 14 days ago.

00:07:21.889 --> 00:07:23.720
And that's important to remember.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.520
Be ready for it because it's going to happen.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:30.569
And don't forget, we're still in the middle
of a pandemic, which some doctors believe

00:07:30.569 --> 00:07:57.000
is still in its beginning phases, which 
is overwhelming to

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:45.279
think about.

